### Scenario: Comments

```elixir
for drop <- dropTablesList do drop.() end
for create <- createTablesList do create.() end
RunSql.query(conn,[
  ~S"delete from comments",
  ~S"delete from posts",
  ~S"delete from users",
  ~S"delete from commentratings",
])
```
